        "finding": "date is organizer-scheduled tournament start. It is not actual start, registration close, deck submission time, creation time, or a card-use timestamp. Documented standings and pairings contain no deck submission/version/immutable historical-use timestamp."
      },
      {
        "id": "DELAY_AND_LATE",
        "source": "https://docs.limitlesstcg.com/organizer/reference",
        "finding": "Configured start prevents an earlier start but does not guarantee an on-time start. Late registration and deck submission can be enabled for the first two Swiss rounds. Current player decklists do not establish contents by the scheduled start."
      },
      {
        "id": "PLAYER_EDITS",
        "source": "https://docs.limitlesstcg.com/player/decklists",
        "finding": "Players may resubmit while submission is open; prior submissions are discarded. This does not establish post-tournament editing. Historical immutability, organizer/admin correction restrictions and a public revision trail were not established."
      },
      {
        "id": "ACTIVE_PLAYER_LOCK",
        "source": "https://docs.limitlesstcg.com/organizer/reference",
        "finding": "Already-playing participants cannot update their decklist under the late-submission option. This documented lock is retained; it does not prove a scheduled-start deadline or immutable post-event history for the API response."
      },
      {
        "id": "SCHEDULE_EDITS",
        "source": "https://docs.limitlesstcg.com/organizer/schedule",
        "finding": "Round schedules can be manually edited, including a round in progress. The public schedule is not an immutable audit log or a safe replacement timestamp."
      },
